"A type variable named as a datatype: FX-26's hides the datatype, as
 Rust's type parameter would; but the Rust names the datatype where the
 FX-26 does not, so KFX names them apart."
(define-effect kfx (maxeff (read @globals) spin))
(define-datatype t (mk i64))
(define f (poly ((t type)) (subr pure (t i64) i64)) (lambda (x n) n))
(f 1 2)
